  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51fb4c6070f247e48b4377b5728b8182, type: 3}
  m_Name: S8_X1_2d
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::StoryScene
  sentences:
  - text: Of course she's still here. She's the definition of a workaholic.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 1
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Miss Moon speaks without looking up from her work.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Did you manage to finish everything? If so, that's very impressive. I'll
      give you that.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0da3ca1f8a6962f4b9b7873516fd35e9, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I walk over and present her with the document.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I am tired but also kind of proud because she just complimented me.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Yes ma'am, everything is done. I only need your approval for this document,
      and I'll finish up for today.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Right, let's see.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0da3ca1f8a6962f4b9b7873516fd35e9, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1baa1407f6863264b8fc68ce06de4f09, type: 3}
  nextScene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 293a4b5c6d7e8f901ab2c3d4e5f60718, type: 2}
